 "p5_offset": {
  "about": "Kernel API 6 (press-pull on curved faces) native values: OCCT 7.9.3 through cadquery-ocp 7.9.3.1.1, computed on 2026-10-06 with a generator kept outside the plugin (scratchpad cad/pp: native_offset.py). offset: BRepOffset_MakeOffset(shape, 0, 1e-7, Skin, Intersection) with SetOffsetOnFace(d) on the picked faces. refillet: BRepAlgoAPI_Defeaturing of the fillet face, then BRepFilletAPI_MakeFillet of the edges its two support faces then share, at the new radius. thick: BRepOffset_MakeOffset thickening a copy of the face by d (turned outside out at negative volume), Fuse (d > 0) / Cut (d < 0), UnifySameDomain on a copy. prism: the API 3 press_pull. Parts: bore = 60 x 40 x 10 plate minus a cylinder r 10 at (30, 20); boss = the plate plus a cylinder r 8, 15 high at (30, 20, 10); fillet = 40 x 30 x 20 box, r 5 on its vertical edge at x 40, y 30; trap = trapezoid (x 0..40 at z 0, 0..30 at z 20) extruded 30 along +Y; cone = 60 x 40 x 10 plate centred on the origin plus a frustum r 10 (z 10) to r 5 (z 20); dome = a cylinder r 10, 10 high under a half sphere; cap = the plate plus a sphere r 10 centred at (30, 20, 4) above z 10; pocket = 40 x 30 x 10 block minus a 20 x 10 pocket 5 deep at (10, 10); loft = through circles r 10 (z 0), 12 (z 10), 8 (z 20). self_ok = BRepAlgoAPI_Check(shape, no small edges, self-interference).",
  "bore": {
